# Seasoned Cryomancer: the reflexive ability targets two Ornithopters; with it on the stack Bot1 bolts the first. As it
# resolves the dead one is no longer a legal target, and the other is still tapped and stunned (CR 608.2b: the
# ability is not countered while one target is legal). Its targets were chosen as it was put on the stack (CR 603.12,
# 603.3d), so the bolt cannot change how many.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Island
Black Lotus
Seasoned Cryomancer
Lightning Bolt
Brainstorm
Island
Island
Force of Will
Dark Ritual
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Seasoned Cryomancer.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Brainstorm; Force of Will)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Counters.Stun = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Counters.Stun = (absent)
